      "response": {
        "content": "I could not confirm that the purchase order for REQ-1 went through, so I reported the requisition as \"unknown\".\n\n- **Supplier choice:** S-1 quoted 5.40 USD per unit and S-2 quoted 5.75 USD. Both are allowlisted and under the 6.00 cap, so S-1 was the cheapest acceptable quote.\n- **Budget:** 100 units at 5.40 comes to 54,000 minor units (540.00 USD). CC-OPS has 80,000 minor units left (100,000 limit minus 20,000 committed), so it fits.\n- **The order:** I submitted the order to S-1 as action A-0001. Its status came back \"outcome_unknown\", and it stayed that way after I waited 30 seconds and checked again. The order may or may not have taken effect.\n- **Escalation:** The system escalated this to a human as ESC-0001.\n- **No resubmission:** I did not submit the order again, because a second submission could create a duplicate order. A person needs to check whether the S-1 order exists before anyone retries.",
